      {
        "type": "Module",
        "name": "led_driver",
        "description": "PT4115 constant‑current LED driver. VIN pin is powered from the external VIN_12V rail; GND (EP) ties to system ground. SW pin delivers the regulated constant‑current output (≈350 mA) to the high‑power LED. CSN pin provides a voltage proportional to LED current for external monitoring (AnalogOut). DIM pin accepts a PWM dimming signal (active‑high) to modulate LED current. Power sequencing: VIN must be present before DIM can be asserted. No internal feedback loop requires additional active components.",
        "id": "led_driver"
      },
